<title>USA: Saudi cuts Arab Medium to U.S. by 30 cts in Feb.</title>
<headline>Saudi cuts Arab Medium to U.S. by 30 cts in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia cut the price of Arab Medium crude to U.S. customers for February by 30 cents, trade sources said Thursday.</p>
<p>Arab Medium is now priced at a discount of $3.95 a barrel to West Texas Intermediate, down from $3.65 a barrel in January.</p>
<p>((--New York Energy Desk +1 212 859 1620))</p>
